ncements/1846651706696759","verified_at":"2026-10-21T01:24:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2973850-1846651706686065","game_id":"steam-2973850","kind":"update","title":"Next Fest demo build patch notes","summary":"NewNew lighting: sun and moon with a day and night cycle, character and scenery shadows, rim light and light shafts. The world reacts to the time of day.Options: Gameplay tab with camera shake, rumble, screen effects, dialogue speed and font size, minimap opacity and language. Video tab with VSync, FPS cap and brightness. Reset per tab.Quick restart after death: hold Jump, or R on keyboard and LT+RT on gamepad.Dash now passes through bosses.Ability pickups you don't have yet now show in the HUD.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T03:46:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706686065","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2973850-1842212951304213","game_id":"steam-2973850","kind":"update","title":"Pre Event Update","summary":"Patch Notes - V0.78.0Out now for Linux and macOS.- Environment - Breakable scenery objects.Lighting, focus and framing system for dialogues.Rabbit City scenery added to all 23 stages.New NPC Larry from Rabbit City.River Forest scenery reviewed and updated.Added pre-boss dialogues.New Battle track for Rabbit!- Mechanics -Platforms with only one active side (player passes through the others).Platforms that fall after you stand on them for a while.Bosses now counter-attack when they take too many h","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-28T19:41:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951304213","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2973850-1830163047261471","game_id":"steam-2973850","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes - V0.75.2","summary":"New Content Achievements: 13 new achievements added! Defeat bosses, complete speedruns, discover secrets, and more. A notification pops up on screen whenever you unlock one. Item Sets: Items now belong to themed collections. Complete a set to earn a special achievement! Comic Book Intro: A comic-style story recaps the events leading up to the adventure every time you launch the game. Hold any button to skip. Breakable Objects: Branches, bamboo, and small scenery objects can now be cut with your ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-17T21:55:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047261471","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2973850-1829528821318743","game_id":"steam-2973850","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes 0.74.3","summary":"v0.74.1 — Dialogue System — Visual Overhaul + Bug Fixes Dialogue System Persona transitions replaced with smooth slide + fade animations. Personas now auto-adjust to match each character's resolution and sprite. Player character is now locked in idle pose while a dialogue is open. Map is hidden during active dialogues. Dialogue text font size slightly reduced. Effects & Ability Fixes Color and effect indices in text with spaces are now calculated correctly. Fixed player X velocity cutoff (was ch","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-14T19:17:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821318743","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2973850-1829528821310937","game_id":"steam-2973850","kind":"update","title":"Patch Notes – V0.74.0","summary":"🔊 V0.73.7Audio and Sound EffectsCreated and added Brunt’s sound effects.Added modularity to sound references, allowing long sounds to be stopped before they finish.Adjusted Hare’s Hurricane sound.Player jump sound now has a defined duration.Added effects to the player's shooting sound.Adjusted the pitch of Dash audio tracks for better consistency.Added modular variations to the player's sounds.🔊 V0.73.8Audio System and OptimizationsAdded compatibility with multiple bosses for the movement \"Draw ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-10T18:07:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1829528821310937","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2973850-1828894815561245","game_id":"steam-2973850","kind":"announcement","title":"V0.73.6","summary":"V0.73.2Added visual feedback for the weight system in the inventory.Improved item selection text.Added new items.V0.73.3Fixed item image issues.Rebalanced Double Jump Boots: jump force reduction changed from 30% → 8%.Fixed an issue where the pause menu would not open due to missing data serialization.Created 2 out of 5 (estimated) post-Brunt tutorial stages.Equipping/unequipping items from the inventory now correctly applies modifiers.Added costs to item selection (visual polish still in progres","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-03T20:20:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815561245","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2973850-1828441623110585","game_id":"steam-2973850","kind":"announcement","title":"V0.73.2","summary":"V0.72.8MovableMovement doors repositioned to avoid contact during mob activation.Removed visuals that impaired the player’s view while moving through passages.Fixed a bug that caused the screen to turn black when entering specific stages.Fixed an issue where Hare would leave her arena during the fight, which in turn broke the camera.V0.72.9UI displaying the player’s movement count has been revised and now works correctly with collectibles.Pogo is now split into 5 object categories: Spike, Damage","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-30T19:46:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828441623110585","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2973850-1827626365765763","game_id":"steam-2973850","kind":"announcement","title":"No-Hi Beta now available!","summary":"Here you can find:Open exploration, but linear progression (Just go! You will reach where you need to be).Fighting combos in a platformer? That's it!Movement cleaner than my bank account at the end of the month.Refreshing fusion of roguelike and metroidvania? Also true!Challenging for the tryhards! But will not suffocate casuals.After almost 4 years...We are so happy and anxious for you guys to test our game!Our Beta has around 20% of the overall content. But the necessary systems are almost 85%","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-24T14:00:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1827626365765763","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2973850-6240387642458523734","game_id":"steam-2973850","kind":"announcement","title":"No-Hi Alpha is now Live!","summary":"Discover an Unforgettable Journey - Join the Alpha of No-Hi! We're beyond excited to announce that the alpha for No-Hi is officially live on Steam! This is your chance to be one of the first players to explore and test the world we've been passionately crafting. At this early stage, we’re eager to hear your feedback and find out what we can improve. Join our community on Discord and become a part of No-Hi's development. Support our project financially, crowdfunding campaign available on Catarse.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2024-08-30T16:46:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/6240387642458523734","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:44:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2973850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:49Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2973850":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2973850":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:49Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:49Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:49Z"},"2973870":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:14:50Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2973850","app_id":2973850,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:10Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"b24a3dc793be7c5e9638c53d040a009c3d28dfaa6a3f052a2b230a5d5d219c6c","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"No-Hi is a parkour platformer, combo your moves to get fast and cut your way with momentum! Explore the map the way you want, never being lost. Face unique bosses with gracious movements. Sinergize itens to make your own gameplay style.","publishers":[{"name":"MTM Games","creator_clan_acc